00:00:00.421 --> 00:00:02.794
Unit nine. Leadership!

2
00:00:03.848 --> 00:00:10.382
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Vibol. Welcome to Secondary English, Level six!

3
00:00:10.432 --> 00:00:13.887
