4
00:00:13.937 --> 00:00:17.414
Today we learn: Leadership. Let's go!

5
00:00:18.820 --> 00:00:23.587
Visionary leadership. Say it with me. Visionary leadership!

6
00:00:27.102 --> 00:00:30.735
Delegate. Say it with me. Delegate!

7
00:00:34.243 --> 00:00:38.276
Inspire. Say it with me. Inspire!

8
00:00:41.762 --> 00:00:47.078
Decision-making authority. Say it with me. Decision-making authority!

9
00:00:50.592 --> 00:00:54.942
Servant leadership. Say it with me. Servant leadership!

10
00:00:58.379 --> 00:01:02.345
Team empowerment. Say it with me. Team empowerment!

11
00:01:05.845 --> 00:01:10.178
Strategic vision. Say it with me. Strategic vision!

12
00:01:13.741 --> 00:01:18.908
Accountability structure. Say it with me. Accountability structure!

13
00:01:22.416 --> 00:01:27.416
Influence positively. Say it with me. Influence positively!

14
00:01:30.907 --> 00:01:35.173
Lead by example. Say it with me. Lead by example!

15
00:01:38.634 --> 00:01:43.035
Collaborative leadership. Say it with me. Collaborative leadership!

16
00:01:46.582 --> 00:01:50.898
Adaptability. Say it with me. Adaptability!

17
00:01:54.455 --> 00:02:03.672
Grammar time! Non-finite clauses. Listen. Leading by example, she inspired the whole team.

18
00:02:03.722 --> 00:02:09.402
Your turn. Say it with me. Leading by example, she inspired the whole team.

19
00:02:14.112 --> 00:02:25.084
Visionary leadership means inspiring others and leading by example. Servant leadership focuses on team empowerment rather than authority alone.

20
00:02:25.134 --> 00:02:26.799
I like this story!

21
00:02:27.634 --> 00:02:32.865
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:32.915 --> 00:02:34.065
Inspire!

23
00:02:35.159 --> 00:02:40.298
Look! What's the word?

24
00:02:40.348 --> 00:02:41.830
Strategic vision!

25
00:02:42.965 --> 00:02:51.116
Think and answer. What leadership qualities do you admire most?

26
00:02:51.166 --> 00:02:52.316
Great answer!

27
00:02:53.411 --> 00:02:57.776
Great work today! See you next time. Bye-bye!

28
